653"},{"id":115,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1420,-229],"size":[380,189],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🧠 Models & LoRAs\n\nKrea-2 int8 distilled turbo (myKrea2UnlockedInt8_v10), Qwen3-VL 4B fp8 encoder (type=krea2), Qwen-Image VAE. LoRA Text Loader applies the inline stack to model AND clip; its trigger words are prepended via the Trigger Word Toggle."],"title":"🧠 Models & LoRAs","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":116,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2055,-178],"size":[380,138],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🔌 Conditioning\n\nPrompt (LoraManager) encodes; Krea2PromptWeight applies the NegPip weights through the encoder. The PreviewAny shows the exact resolved text."],"title":"🔌 Conditioning","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":117,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2840,-535],"size":[380,495],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 🎛️ Sampling\n\nKrea-2 turbo: 11 steps, CFG 1.0, euler/simple, denoise 1.0. Measured ~90 s per 1344x768 plate with 3 LoRAs. Seed is a PrimitiveInt (fixed) feeding both the sampler and the prompt node; render.py sets it from the job row."],"title":"🎛️ Sampling","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":118,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[4215,-161],"size":[340,121],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"draftsman":"comfy-draftsman"},"widgets_values":["### 💾 Output\n\nSave Image (LoraManager) embeds seed/model/LoRA/prompt metadata in the PNG. filename_prefix is set per job by render.py."],"title":"💾 Output","color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,1,0,8,0,"MODEL"],[2,2,0,8,2,"CLIP"],[6,7,0,8,1,"STRING"],[8,8,1,11,0,"CLIP"],[9,8,2,9,3,"STRING"],[11,9,0,11,2,"STRING"],[13,14,0,11,1,"INT"],[14,11,0,12,0,"CONDITIONING"],[16,3,0,17,1,"VAE"],[18,12,0,16,2,"C